hook-redactor src/patterns.rs: ps_secret_field_matches_client_secret.
client_secret stops at the closing quote (#84), so both rules have the same
value span and ps_secret_field wins on rule order; the quotes stay.
-- input --
ClientSecret = 's3cretValue123abc'
-- must_contain --
<redacted:api_key>
-- must_not_contain --
s3cretValue
-- want --
ClientSecret = '<redacted:api_key>'
-- deviation --
prefix
